// SDK's GetDashboard query-params schema (so productIds stays in sync): drop tenancyScope (it is an
// app-global store — see @/stores/useTenancyStore) and the required dates, then `.and` defaulted
// dates (last 30 days). Exported so the Storybook story mounts the data under a matching router.
